msgstr "Y 偏移"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_datascope.xml
#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_pixelize.xml
#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_prewitt.xml
