msgstr "设置方向的半径"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_dblur.xml
#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_scharr.xml
#: rc.cpp:5496 rc.cpp:6846
#, kde-format
