#: rc.cpp:6938
#, kde-format
msgid "Blur the input video without impacting the outlines."
msgstr "模糊输入视频而不影响轮廓。"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_smartblur.xml
#: rc.cpp:6940
#, kde-format
msgid "Luma radius"
msgstr "亮度半径"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_smartblur.xml
#: rc.cpp:6942
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Set the luma radius.<br>\n"
"            The value specifies the variance of the gaussian filter used to "
"blur the image (slower if larger)."
msgstr ""
"设置亮度半径。<br>\n"
"            该值指定用于模糊图像的高斯滤镜的方差 (值越大，处理越慢) 。"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_smartblur.xml
#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_unsharp.xml
#: rc.cpp:6944 rc.cpp:7186
#, kde-format
msgid "Luma strength"
msgstr "亮度强度"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_smartblur.xml
#: rc.cpp:6946
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Set the luma strength.<br>\n"
"            The value configures the blurring. A positive value will blur "
"the image, whereas a negative value will sharpen the image."
msgstr ""
"设置亮度强度。<br>\n"
"            该值用于配置模糊效果。正值会使图像模糊，而负值则会使图像锐化。"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_smartblur.xml
#: rc.cpp:6948
#, kde-format
msgid "Luma threshold"
msgstr "亮度阈值"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_smartblur.xml
#: rc.cpp:6950
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Set the luma threshold used as a coefficient<br>\n"
"            to determine whether a pixel should be blurred or not. A value "
"of 0 will filter all the image, positive values will filter flat areas, "
"negative values will filter edges."
msgstr ""
"设置亮度阈值<br>\n"
"            该值将确定是否应对像素进行模糊处理。值为 0 时将对整个图像进行滤镜"
"处理，正值将滤除平坦区域，负值将滤除边缘。"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_smartblur.xml
#: rc.cpp:6952
#, kde-format
msgid "Chroma radius"
msgstr "色度半径"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_smartblur.xml
#: rc.cpp:6954
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Set the chroma radius.<br>\n"
"            The value specifies the variance of the gaussian filter used to "
"blur the image (slower if larger). If not specified, it defaults to the "
"value set for <em>Luma radius</em>"
msgstr ""
"设置色度半径。<br>\n"
"            该值指定用于模糊图像的高斯滤镜的方差 (值越大处理越慢) 。若未指"
"定，则默认使用<em>亮度半径</em>所设的值。"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_smartblur.xml
#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_unsharp.xml
#: rc.cpp:6956 rc.cpp:7198
#, kde-format
msgid "Chroma strength"
msgstr "色度强度"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_smartblur.xml
#: rc.cpp:6958
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Set the chroma strength.<br>\n"
"            The value configures the blurring. A positive value will blur "
"the image, whereas a negative value will sharpen the image. If not "
"specified, it defaults to the value set for <em>Luma strength</em>."
msgstr ""
"设置色度强度。<br>\n"
"            该值用于配置模糊效果。正值会使图像模糊，而负值则会使图像锐化。若"
"未指定，则默认使用<em>亮度强度</em>所设定的值。"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_smartblur.xml
#: rc.cpp:6960
#, kde-format
msgid "Chroma threshold"
msgstr "色度阈值"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_smartblur.xml
#: rc.cpp:6962
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Set the chroma threshold used as a coefficient<br>\n"
"            to determine whether a pixel should be blurred or not. A value "
"of 0 will filter all the image, positive values will filter flat areas, "
"negative values will filter edges. If not specified, it defaults to the "
"value set for <em>Luma threshold</em>"
msgstr ""
"设置色度阈值<br>\n"
"            该值将确定是否应对某个像素进行模糊处理。值为 0 时将对整个图像进行"
"滤镜处理，正值将滤除平坦区域，负值将滤除边缘。若未指定，则默认使用<em>亮度阈"
"值</em>所设定的值。"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_smartblur.xml
