"TAP Reverberator (LADSPA 2142)<br>\n"
"   Versatile reverb filter based on the comb/allpass filter model. For "
"recommended decay times for reverb types refer to the effect documentation "
"linked below."
msgstr ""
"TAP 混响器 (LADSPA 2142)<br>\n"
"   基于梳状/全通滤波器模型的多功能混响效果器。有关各类混响推荐的衰减时间，请"
